{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35628","headline":"早春微雨 · 李山甫","name":"早春微雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怪来莺蝶似凝愁，不觉看花蹔湿头。\n疎影未藏千里树，远阴微翳万家楼。\n青罗舞袖纷纷转，红脸啼珠旋旋收。\n岁旱且须教济物，爲霖何事爱风流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35628.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35628","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}